title: Opening Sequence — Path E: Post-Alarm Collision Death
story: no-signal-home
description: Tests the 20-turn post-alarm timer — silence alarm but never dock, die on collision

---

## Move to cockpit and silence alarm immediately

> south
[OK: contains "Tug Cockpit"]

> press button
[OK: contains "alarm"]
[OK: contains "Stillwater"]
[EVENT: true, type="action.success" messageId="story.alarm.silenced"]

## Waste turns — fuse starts counting after alarm silenced
## Need 20 elapsed turns. Some commands may be free, so add extras.

> examine instrument panels
[OK: contains_any "instruments" "readouts" "panels" "Instrument"]

> examine fuel gauge
[OK: contains_any "fuel" "percent" "three"]

> examine comms system
[OK: contains_any "comms" "signal" "relay"]

> examine pilot's seat
[OK: contains_any "cushion" "straps" "sat here"]

> examine docking controls
[OK: contains_any "docking" "MANEUVER"]

> examine alarm button
[OK: contains_any "button" "alarm" "already"]

> examine viewport
[OK: contains_any "viewport" "hull" "Stillwater"]

## Go to cargo hold for more filler

> north
[OK: contains "Tug Cargo Hold"]

> examine crates
[OK: contains "DEEP REACH SALVAGE"]

> examine bedroll
[OK: contains "sleeping pad"]

> examine datapad
[OK: contains "DRIFT MODE"]

> take flashlight
[OK: contains_any "flashlight" "Taken"]

> take ration bar
[OK: contains_any "ration" "Taken"]

> drop flashlight
[OK: contains_any "Dropped" "dropped" "flashlight"]

> take flashlight
[OK: contains_any "flashlight" "Taken"]

> drop ration bar
[OK: contains_any "Dropped" "dropped" "ration"]

> take ration bar
[OK: contains_any "ration" "Taken"]

## Back to cockpit for final turns

> south
[OK: contains "Tug Cockpit"]

> examine fuel gauge
[OK: contains_any "fuel" "percent" "three"]

> examine comms system
[OK: contains_any "comms" "signal" "relay"]

> examine instrument panels
[OK: contains_any "instruments" "readouts" "panels" "Instrument"]

> examine alarm button
[OK: contains_any "button" "alarm" "already"]

## By now elapsed should be >= 20 — collision death

> examine viewport
[OK: contains_any "fills everything" "DIED" "collision" "hull" "out of time"]
[EVENT: true, type="game.ended" reason="death"]
